  restartButton: {fileID: 93228135}
  quitButton: {fileID: 103156677}
  creditsText: "<b>Credits</b>\nNight Watch, INTE 42312 Virtual and Augmented Reality
    group project.\n\n<b>3D models, CC BY 4.0</b>\nElephant: \"Low poly Realistic
    Elephant 3d model free\" by iRahulRajput (Sketchfab). Rigged and animated for
    this project.\nElectric fence: \"Wire Fence\" by Pixel-bit (Sketchfab).\nShed:
    \"Worn Shed PBR Game-Ready\" by donnichols (Sketchfab).\n\n<b>Free assets, CC0</b>\nVillage
    models and textures: Poly Haven (Amal Kumar, Rob Tuytel, Rico Cilliers, Greg
    Zaal, Charlotte Baglioni, Dario Barresi, Dimitrios Savva, Aron \u0141yczek, Jenelle
    van Heerden, Kless Gyzen, Sebastian Platen, Kuutti Siitonen, James Ray Cock,
    Miroslav Turura, eye-candy.xyz).\nNeighbour, cow and bull: Quaternius.\nSky:
    Cloudy Skyboxes by Screaming Brain Studios.\n\n<b>Font</b>\nCinzel by The Cinzel
    Project Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1.\n\nBuilt with Unity, XR Interaction
    Toolkit, OpenXR and AI Navigation. Sounds made in code by the team.\nFull list
    with links: CREDITS.md"
